# Copy to apps/web/.env.test and fill in. Read only by the Playwright smoke
# test (`pnpm test:e2e`), which signs in through the real form.
#
# This is a second environment file rather than two more lines in `.env.local`
# on purpose: the account here must not be the one you develop against, or a
# test run would edit your own Job Applications. Create it in the
# `job-tracker-dev` project — Authentication → Users → Add user, with
# _Auto Confirm User_ ticked. See docs/setup/supabase.md.
#
# It is also separate from the API tests' users, which are fixed identifiers in
# `lib/test-support/users.ts` and no account at all.

E2E_EMAIL=""
E2E_PASSWORD=""
